   "text": "which separately running things take part when you /slice, draw, build and push \u2014 and where does each run? \u00b7 example: one /draw round: you press Send in the browser, the session reads the board, draws back, the tab updates \u00b7 mode: as-is \u00b7 level: system \u2014 a box with a link opens its detail board",
